### Health check
GET https://localhost:49359/health

### Triage an angry billing ticket
POST https://localhost:49359/api/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Charged twice this month!!",
  "body": "I just checked my bank statement and you charged my card TWICE for the same subscription. This is unacceptable, I want a refund immediately.",
  "customerTier": "Pro"
}

### Triage a feature request
POST https://localhost:49359/api/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Dark mode?",
  "body": "Love the product. Any chance you could add a dark mode to the dashboard? My eyes would thank you.",
  "customerTier": "Free"
}
